#: hair_net/data.py:22
msgid "Active"
msgstr "活动"

#: hair_net/data.py:22
msgid "Add the guide hairs to the active particle system. Requires an existing particle system to be active."
msgstr "将引导毛发添加到活动粒子系统。需要现有粒子系统处于活动状态。"

