#: hair_net/hair_net.py:659
msgid "Could not create particle. Please see the Troubleshooting section of the README"
msgstr "无法创建粒子。请参阅 README 的疑难解答部分"

#: hair_net/data.py:25
msgid "Creates a new particle system with copied particle settings. Changes to these settings will not affect current particle systems."
msgstr "使用复制的粒子设置创建新粒子系统。对这些设置的更改不会影响当前粒子系统。"

#: hair_net/data.py:23
msgid "Creates a new particle system with new particle settings."
msgstr "使用新的粒子设置创建新粒子系统。"

#: hair_net/data.py:24
msgid "Creates a new particle system with settings linked to existing particle settings. Any changes made to these settings will also change all other particle systems with the same settings."
msgstr "创建新粒子系统，其设置链接到现有粒子设置。对这些设置的任何更改也会影响所有使用相同设置的其他粒子系统。"

